 address for calendar event; media upload validation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- sms_router.py: add missing 'Request' import — without it every inbound
  SMS webhook call would crash with NameError on startup (introduced when
  request: Request was added to inbound_webhook but the import was missed)
- sms_service.py: remove unreachable duplicate Message block in send_mms()
  that appeared after 'return message' — dead code, never executed
- calendar_router.py: initialize event_start = None before the MS365 block
  so the Google Calendar block below can safely reference it; replace
  fragile 'event_start' not in dir() check with clean 'event_start is None'
- calendar_router.py: fetch org record during booking so calendar event
  location uses org.org_address when available (falls back to hardcoded
  Restland address for orgs with no address on file)
- sms_router.py: upload_media now validates file extension (jpg/jpeg/png/
  gif/pdf only) and enforces 5MB limit via streaming read — prevents
  arbitrary file storage and memory pressure

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
